DailyPaper Skills

This repository is a derivative work based on:

  dailypaper-skills by huangkiki and contributors
  https://github.com/huangkiki/dailypaper-skills

The original project introduced the Claude Code workflow for discovering,
reviewing, reading, and organizing academic papers in an Obsidian Vault.

This repository retains the original Git history and includes substantial
subsequent modifications by zhonghao and contributors, including portable
Claude Code and Codex packaging, resumable cross-machine Vault coordination,
configuration onboarding, deterministic lifecycle contracts, and hardened
runtime boundaries.

This derivative is not an official release of the upstream project.
